# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/ship-4 window (the combined ship candidate; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/ship-4 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the
# order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-ship-4 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head WITH the K64j-OQ graft (sed -i 's/tp4-ship-4/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file
# the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. This window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# B0 (STOP): the WINDOW image tp4-ship-4, built from the pushed tp4/ship-4 head: the production profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic baked as the
# serving default with a session cap of 8, plus C2_BAKE_GRAFT=K64j-OQ (the prefill SDPA with one q chunk per core: the image's _ttnncpp.so is K64j plus the prefill
# factory's oneq edits, inert unless QWEN_FAST_SDPA_PF_ONEQ=1), the octo modules, audit_sampling, every fusion package's files (the overlay manifest) and the host tier
# (version 2 of the qwen_kv_read extension: the raw block read and write, built on the prefix-tiers branch and pinned in the Dockerfile). THE IMAGE IS A GATE-WINDOW IMAGE
# ONLY: the candidate's decision is PENDING, and a PENDING profile is never baked (B1 builds the ship image from the commit that records the approval). READ: "baking the
# serving default c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic with a session cap of 8", the provenance report with no problem line, its K64j-OQ graft line and its
# "[KVREAD] qwen_kv_read 2" line, the closure checks, the image id. A build, not a card job; no privileged builder container may be up and no card job may run during it.
# Estimate from the last builds: 35-40 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=build
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-ship-4
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4
C2_BAKE_DEFAULT_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic
C2_BAKE_GRAFT=K64j-OQ
